# Button

The Button component is a clickable element that triggers an action.

## Installation

<Tabs>
  <TabItem label="pnpm">
    ```bash
    pnpm add @aetherui/core
    ```
  </TabItem>
  <TabItem label="npm">
    ```bash
    npm install @aetherui/core
    ```
  </TabItem>
  <TabItem label="yarn">
    ```bash
    yarn add @aetherui/core
    ```
  </TabItem>
</Tabs>

## Basic Usage

<ButtonExample
  code={`<ae-button>Default Button</ae-button>`}
  preview={`<ae-button>Default Button</ae-button>`}
/>

## Variants

<ButtonExample
  code={`<ae-button variant="primary">Primary</ae-button>
<ae-button variant="secondary">Secondary</ae-button>
<ae-button variant="ghost">Ghost</ae-button>`}
  preview={`<ae-button variant="primary">Primary</ae-button>
<ae-button variant="secondary">Secondary</ae-button>
<ae-button variant="ghost">Ghost</ae-button>`}
/>

## Sizes

<ButtonExample
  code={`<ae-button size="sm">Small</ae-button>
<ae-button size="md">Medium</ae-button>
<ae-button size="lg">Large</ae-button>`}
  preview={`<ae-button size="sm">Small</ae-button>
<ae-button size="md">Medium</ae-button>
<ae-button size="lg">Large</ae-button>`}
/>

## Disabled State

<ButtonExample
  code={`<ae-button disabled>Disabled Button</ae-button>
<ae-button variant="secondary" disabled>Disabled Secondary</ae-button>
<ae-button variant="ghost" disabled>Disabled Ghost</ae-button>`}
  preview={`<ae-button disabled>Disabled Button</ae-button>
<ae-button variant="secondary" disabled>Disabled Secondary</ae-button>
<ae-button variant="ghost" disabled>Disabled Ghost</ae-button>`}
/>

