## Props

| Name | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `variant` | `'primary' \| 'secondary' \| 'ghost'` | `'primary'` | The visual style variant of the button |
| `size` | `'sm' \| 'md' \| 'lg'` | `'md'` | The size of the button |
| `disabled` | `boolean` | `false` | Whether the button is disabled |

## Slots

| Name | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `default` | The button's label text |
| `prefix` | Content to place before the label |
| `suffix` | Content to place after the label |

## CSS Parts

| Name | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `button` | The button element |

## CSS Custom Properties

| Name | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `--ae-color-primary` | Primary button background color |
| `--ae-color-primary-hover` | Primary button hover background color |
| `--ae-color-secondary` | Secondary button background color |
| `--ae-color-secondary-hover` | Secondary button hover background color |
| `--ae-color-text` | Button text color |
| `--ae-border-radius` | Button border radius |

## Accessibility

The button component follows WAI-ARIA guidelines:

- Uses native `<button>` element
- Supports keyboard navigation
- Maintains proper focus management
- Includes proper ARIA attributes when disabled

